# navigation: menu, contents, page number, search, bookmarks, quotes
1 DOWN 5 shot open
LSOFT shot menu
5 shot toc
DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN 5 shot toc_jump
LSOFT DOWN 5 shot goto
1 2 shot goto_typed
CENTER shot page12
LSOFT 5 shot toc_current
# back 10 pages to page 2 and search from there
RSOFT 1 LSOFT DOWN DOWN 5 shot search
# "таблица" by multi-tap in the Russian layout; > ends a letter
6 6 6 2 RIGHT 2 2 4 4 4 4 RIGHT 4 7 7 7 2 shot search_typed
CENTER shot found
HASH shot found2
RSOFT shot found_normal
HASH shot found3
# a bookmark on the page, a quote from word to word
RSOFT STAR shot bookmark
5 RIGHT STAR RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT DOWN shot quote_sel
5 shot quote_saved
RSOFT LSOFT DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN 5 shot marks
DOWN 5 shot quote_actions
DOWN DOWN 5 shot quote_text
RSOFT RSOFT shot back_to_page
LSOFT UP 5 shot keys
# the bookmarks are in state/, read again when the book is opened
RSOFT RSOFT 5 LSOFT DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN 5 shot marks_reopen
5 5 shot mark_jump
RSOFT shot shelf
